    {"source": "IMG_1066", "start": 0.92, "end": 5.40,  "punch": false, "beat": "INTRO",    "quote": "Welcome guys to day seven, and boy, do I have information for you all"},
    {"source": "IMG_1067", "start": 1.08, "end": 7.26,  "punch": false, "beat": "OVERVIEW", "quote": "The implementation of this bot will come in five stages: baca berita, filter duplikat, cari stok yang kena,"},
    {"source": "IMG_1067", "start": 7.52, "end": 12.66, "punch": true,  "beat": "OVERVIEW", "quote": "membuat keputusan buy atau sell, dan terakhir cek jika trade itu aman."},
    {"source": "IMG_1068", "start": 2.54, "end": 3.92,  "punch": false, "beat": "DEDUP",    "quote": "Duplicates are dangerous."},
    {"source": "IMG_1068", "start": 4.34, "end": 4.78,  "punch": true,  "beat": "DEDUP",    "quote": "Why?"},
    {"source": "IMG_1068", "start": 5.12, "end": 7.00,  "punch": false, "beat": "DEDUP",    "quote": "News are republished over and over again."},
    {"source": "IMG_1068", "start": 7.28, "end": 17.94, "punch": true,  "beat": "DEDUP",    "quote": "Jika bot kita kirain bahwa news itu baru, maka ia akan trade terus... it's no longer an edge. So kita akan fokus dengan news baru aja."},
    {"source": "IMG_1070", "start": 1.46, "end": 2.88,  "punch": false, "beat": "RULES",    "quote": "Before implementing the algorithm,"},
    {"source": "IMG_1070", "start": 3.14, "end": 6.82,  "punch": true,  "beat": "RULES",    "quote": "we will first have to establish some basic rules first for the bot. Misalnya,"},
    {"source": "IMG_1070", "start": 7.06, "end": 9.90,  "punch": false, "beat": "RULES",    "quote": "jika ada merger di perusahaan, maka kita akan buy."},
    {"source": "IMG_1070", "start": 10.38, "end": 13.74, "punch": true, "beat": "RULES",    "quote": "Demikian pula kita bisa menjelaskan semua trade dengan logika"},
    {"source": "IMG_1071", "start": 0.54, "end": 12.94, "punch": false, "beat": "SAFETY",   "quote": "Dan yang terakhir, cek keamanan... maka akan ada kill switch yang akan mematikan program itu untuk hari itu"},
    {"source": "IMG_1073", "start": 1.02, "end": 10.00, "punch": false, "beat": "ROADMAP",  "quote": "Jadi, bulan pertama we're gonna collect news. Bulan kedua we're gonna implement all the rules. Bulan tiga dan empat kita akan mulai"},
    {"source": "IMG_1073", "start": 10.30, "end": 18.08, "punch": true, "beat": "ROADMAP",  "quote": "backtesting sama paper trading. Dan jika tidak ada perubahan lainnya, bulan kelima kita akan mulai live trading."},
    {"source": "IMG_1074", "start": 1.04, "end": 2.92,  "punch": false, "beat": "OUTRO",    "quote": "So that's the entire pipeline."},
